   #21    salary    7333.33  born 1965-06-15  joined 2010-01-04  period 2024-02-01  legacy     0.00  rewrite    10.00
   #27    salary    7714.28  born 1965-06-15  joined 2010-01-04  period 2024-02-01  legacy    12.85  rewrite    12.86
